 "title": "A knot-law repeat of odd length: period 61",
 "subject": "Whether not-all-equal bases along one shift whose states all repeat can have an odd period",
 "conclusion": "Twelve not-all-equal knot kinds, forbidding three equal values at equal spacing with step 1, 2, 11 or 22 modulo 61, allow only states that repeat with period 61 (proved): an odd harmony. No such base has an odd period up to 29 or at 31 or 37, so the knot law's repeats are not all even.",
